WEBVTT

00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:05.800
Everyone, when you're watching Deltora Quest,

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:09.100
make sure you're in a well-lit
room and sit far away from the TV!

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:24.080
You are my sun now

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:28.460
We all go through bad times

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:31.460
no matter who you are

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:36.890
So don't go hanging your head and feeling down

00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:45.640
Keep your head up until your heart's sky

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:51.030
is clear again

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:56.360
No matter where you are in this world

00:00:56.360 --> 00:00:59.870
if you're crying and trembling all alone

00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:05.210
I'll search for you, I promise

00:01:05.410 --> 00:01:08.880
Love will show me the way

00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:16.720
The sun dreams countless times

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:23.560
Forever and always from the horizon

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:30.900
Its shining light gives energy

00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:38.240
After all, you are my sun now

00:01:39.910 --> 00:01:54.800
The Japanese Deltora Quest is brought to you in English by ToranSubs

00:01:56.160 --> 00:01:57.390
<i>My name is Lief.</i>

00:01:57.610 --> 00:02:02.670
<i>I'm travelling with Jasmine and Barda to take back the gems that were stolen by the Shadow Lord.</i>

00:02:02.670 --> 00:02:04.670
<i>And there are only two gems left!</i>

00:02:04.670 --> 00:02:10.720
<i>However, the Shadow Lord is now hunting for a boy, a man and a wild girl with a black bird.</i>

00:02:10.720 --> 00:02:15.300
<i>Why am I the 'wild one', anyway?
Honestly, the Shadow Lord has no taste.</i>

00:02:16.330 --> 00:02:19.200
<i>Our journey is sure to become
more perilous from now on!</i>

00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:24.600
<i>Right now, we're headed to the Maze of the Beast, where the sixth gem is hidden!</i>

00:02:33.710 --> 00:02:35.880
So next is the Maze of the Beast, huh...

00:02:35.890 --> 00:02:40.910
According to the Kin, we just need to head west for the River Tor, right?

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:46.520
What's wrong, Kree?

00:02:49.030 --> 00:02:50.000
What was that?!

00:02:52.360 --> 00:02:53.100
Watch out!

00:02:56.030 --> 00:02:57.300
The Carn Unit again...?

00:02:57.300 --> 00:02:58.910
These guys sure are persistent!

00:02:59.290 --> 00:03:03.600
Kree's warning was extremely helpful. They won't be able to hit us from this distance!

00:03:04.580 --> 00:03:06.140
Lucky bastards.

00:03:11.650 --> 00:03:12.590
They're coming!

00:03:16.040 --> 00:03:16.790
After them!

00:03:18.110 --> 00:03:21.810
You did well to escape that
Vraal last time, however...

00:03:22.360 --> 00:03:24.170
you won't escape this time!

00:03:35.120 --> 00:03:37.600
No trace of them...
Where did they disappear to?

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:40.670
Although, they couldn't have gotten far.

00:03:40.670 --> 00:03:43.000
We are the Hell Hound Carn Unit!

00:03:43.500 --> 00:03:45.500
Find those three no matter what!

00:03:52.440 --> 00:03:54.500
Really, those guys just won't give up...!

00:03:55.070 --> 00:03:57.200
We can't just hide forever.

00:03:57.450 --> 00:04:00.400
Over there. Let's escape into that forest.

00:04:11.660 --> 00:04:16.400
We can't stay here for too long; it's them we're dealing with, after all.

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:18.530
They're sure to scour this forest in time.

00:04:18.530 --> 00:04:19.180
Yeah.

00:04:25.420 --> 00:04:26.280
What's wrong?

00:04:27.680 --> 00:04:31.360
This forest feels... a little weird...

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:43.000
Yeah. I'm not sure what it is, but
something is making me feel uneasy.

00:04:43.440 --> 00:04:46.990
Well, we <i>did</i> just escape from the Carn Unit.

00:04:48.110 --> 00:04:51.600
Maybe it's because this place is too quiet...? Something's just not right.

00:04:55.560 --> 00:04:56.880
Is it the Carn Unit...?

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:06.260
It's an owl!

00:05:06.260 --> 00:05:07.600
That really startled me...

00:05:14.360 --> 00:05:15.920
Are you mocking me, or what?!

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:17.950
That's probably just how it hoots.

00:05:17.950 --> 00:05:19.470
A laughing owl, I suppose.

00:05:24.870 --> 00:05:26.510
What did you do that for, Lief?!

00:05:36.810 --> 00:05:37.570
Shut up!!

00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:42.110
What do you mean 'shut up'?! The poor thing... Look before you attack!

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:43.430
I was startled, okay?!

00:05:43.430 --> 00:05:45.460
That still doesn't make it okay!

00:05:46.010 --> 00:05:49.770
Cut it out, you two! We need stay silent!

00:05:50.060 --> 00:05:51.310
I know that...!

00:05:51.540 --> 00:05:54.000
Don't you think this fog
is a little weird as well?

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:56.310
It feels almost hostile, doesn't it?

00:05:56.920 --> 00:05:58.990
Aren't you the hostile one here, Jasmine?!

00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:06.000
They've found us...

00:06:06.300 --> 00:06:08.220
That's because you keep shouting, Lief!

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:10.300
That was a signal flare.

00:06:10.800 --> 00:06:12.750
Let's get out of here before
the rest of them arrive!

00:06:33.770 --> 00:06:35.300
I can't see anything...

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:41.720
Darn, where in the world is this...?

00:06:43.760 --> 00:06:45.530
I got separated from them...

00:06:49.470 --> 00:06:50.220
Barda!

00:06:51.520 --> 00:06:55.000
What am I thinking? The Carn
Unit will find me if I shout...

00:06:56.320 --> 00:06:57.660
Calm down...

00:06:58.100 --> 00:06:59.760
Calm yourself and think...

00:07:00.460 --> 00:07:05.230
The topaz should be able to clear my mind, and guard against the terrors of the night.

00:07:08.620 --> 00:07:10.980
The topaz has helped me to calm down a bit.

00:07:13.920 --> 00:07:17.240
Come to think of it, the place
where we first met Jasmine,

00:07:17.240 --> 00:07:21.320
and found the first gem, the topaz, was also a forest like this, wasn't it...

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:32.860
Where... is this place...?

00:07:37.050 --> 00:07:38.120
My body...

00:07:40.110 --> 00:07:41.250
What's going on here...?

00:07:43.290 --> 00:07:44.200
Barda...

00:07:51.050 --> 00:07:52.230
What does <i>he</i> want?

00:08:07.160 --> 00:08:09.330
My thanks, you've saved us.

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:12.230
Hey Filli, this looks pretty good, don't you think?

00:08:12.720 --> 00:08:17.210
The swords? I have so many of them already, and it's not like you can use them, right?

00:08:17.210 --> 00:08:18.500
What are you talking about?

00:08:20.840 --> 00:08:24.100
See? It's fortunate that we took this path,

00:08:24.100 --> 00:08:27.190
after all, there probably won't be
anything left here by tomorrow.

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:28.910
She's... a mugger?!

00:08:28.910 --> 00:08:30.400
H-Hey, wait!

00:08:30.500 --> 00:08:32.850
Look at this, Kree! We have some new loot.

00:08:34.600 --> 00:08:36.760
Stop! That's from my mother...!

00:08:38.630 --> 00:08:40.200
What mother, exactly?

00:08:41.210 --> 00:08:42.780
Hey, listen to us!

00:08:43.300 --> 00:08:45.530
Do you intend to just leave us here?!

00:08:46.490 --> 00:08:49.200
I'll tell you just one thing out of pity.

00:08:49.800 --> 00:08:51.900
You two were attacked by the 'Wenn'.

00:08:52.230 --> 00:08:56.800
They brought you here as an
offering to the monster 'Wennbar'.

00:08:57.350 --> 00:09:00.010
The Wennbar likes fresh meat, after all.

00:09:00.160 --> 00:09:01.000
Wennbar...?

00:09:01.360 --> 00:09:05.850
Once the sun has gone down, the Wennbar will come; to eat you both, that is.

00:09:11.150 --> 00:09:15.640
Leaving us like that to go into
the forest alone was a bit harsh.

00:09:15.640 --> 00:09:16.500
But,

00:09:17.400 --> 00:09:21.900
it was also thanks to her that
we were able to get the topaz.

00:09:23.740 --> 00:09:28.200
<i>Gorl thought that we had
come to take the Lilies of Life,</i>

00:09:28.200 --> 00:09:30.900
<i>the nectar of which was
said to grant immortality.</i>

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:36.000
Gorl!!

00:09:39.870 --> 00:09:40.910
Over here!

00:09:41.380 --> 00:09:43.360
Lief! Get to the centre of the area!

00:09:43.360 --> 00:09:43.460
What are you doing?!
Lief! Get to the centre of the area!

00:09:43.460 --> 00:09:43.940
What are you doing?!

00:09:43.940 --> 00:09:44.400
<i>But, Jasmine saved our lives back then.
What are you doing?!</i>

00:09:44.400 --> 00:09:46.800
<i>But, Jasmine saved our lives back then.</i>

00:09:49.660 --> 00:09:53.820
<i>And that's how we were able to
acquire the first gem, the topaz.</i>

00:10:00.420 --> 00:10:02.910
Thank goodness, you seem to be alright.

00:10:03.740 --> 00:10:06.290
I wonder if Lief and Barda are okay...

00:10:09.110 --> 00:10:11.900
Even though all I had were
Filli and Kree in the beginning.

00:10:12.810 --> 00:10:18.780
After all, I only went with them originally because I saw a vision of Mum in the Forests of Silence...

00:10:25.980 --> 00:10:28.310
Filli? Kree?

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:35.700
Jasmine... Jasmine...

00:10:36.200 --> 00:10:38.100
My beautiful Jasmine.

00:10:38.660 --> 00:10:39.600
Mum!

00:10:41.700 --> 00:10:43.050
Mum!

00:10:43.420 --> 00:10:44.410
Jasmine...

00:10:47.020 --> 00:10:49.710
Where have you been, Mum?

00:10:53.690 --> 00:10:55.200
I'm sorry, Jasmine,

00:10:55.500 --> 00:10:57.200
I don't have much time.

00:10:57.660 --> 00:11:00.500
So listen carefully to what I'm about to say.

00:11:01.580 --> 00:11:06.870
You've been doing so well since you were separated from your Dad and I.

00:11:07.690 --> 00:11:11.840
But from now on, you must face
an even greater challenge.

00:11:12.300 --> 00:11:13.400
Look.

00:11:14.150 --> 00:11:16.400
Lief and Barda...

00:11:16.400 --> 00:11:18.400
Those two are your allies.

00:11:18.750 --> 00:11:23.770
They're both travelling to free
Deltora from the Shadow Lord.

00:11:25.680 --> 00:11:27.040
Mum...?

00:11:27.520 --> 00:11:29.000
Therefore Jasmine,

00:11:29.500 --> 00:11:33.100
you must leave this forest and join them.

00:11:33.100 --> 00:11:35.100
Please help them.

00:11:35.500 --> 00:11:38.130
It is your destiny.

00:11:38.550 --> 00:11:39.900
Okay...

00:11:40.500 --> 00:11:41.900
But Mum...

00:11:42.400 --> 00:11:45.790
I will always be here watching over you.

00:11:46.100 --> 00:11:47.190
Jasmine...

00:11:47.190 --> 00:11:48.810
my beautiful girl...

00:11:51.120 --> 00:11:54.940
Those two couldn't have been
attacked by the Carn Unit, right...?

00:11:59.360 --> 00:12:01.500
Will I really be able to
meet with them again...?

00:12:03.920 --> 00:12:05.810
I hope those two are safe...

00:12:07.410 --> 00:12:09.890
I hope I can see them again...

00:12:29.840 --> 00:12:31.830
I wonder where those two went...

00:12:42.580 --> 00:12:46.410
Come to think of it, we got the second gem, the ruby, on a lake didn't we?

00:12:49.280 --> 00:12:53.190
<i>We encountered a monster called
Soldeen in the Lake of Tears.</i>

00:12:55.330 --> 00:12:59.600
-The topaz is...!
<i>However, Soldeen actually gave the gem to us after the topaz purified his heart.</i>

00:12:59.600 --> 00:13:01.200
-Look, they're coming back!

00:13:02.520 --> 00:13:03.290
<i>But then...</i>

00:13:07.640 --> 00:13:09.500
<i>The legendary sorceress Thaegan appeared.</i>

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:09.900
-Thae...!

00:13:09.900 --> 00:13:10.460
<i>And in order to defeat Thaegan, our only option was to draw blood from her.
-Thae...!</i>

00:13:10.460 --> 00:13:11.150
-Jasmine!
<i>And in order to defeat Thaegan, our only option was to draw blood from her.</i>

00:13:11.150 --> 00:13:12.450
<i>And in order to defeat Thaegan, our only option was to draw blood from her.</i>

00:13:12.450 --> 00:13:13.250
-...gan!
<i>And in order to defeat Thaegan, our only option was to draw blood from her.</i>

00:13:13.250 --> 00:13:13.800
<i>And in order to defeat Thaegan, our only option was to draw blood from her.</i>

00:13:14.120 --> 00:13:15.300
<i>But Thaegan was much
stronger than we thought.</i>

00:13:15.300 --> 00:13:16.700
-Thaegan!
<i>But Thaegan was much
stronger than we thought.</i>

00:13:16.700 --> 00:13:16.800
<i>But Thaegan was much
stronger than we thought.</i>

00:13:27.180 --> 00:13:29.900
We were saved by Kree back
then too, weren't we...

00:13:30.400 --> 00:13:32.700
I hope nothing happened to Kree and Filli...

00:13:36.780 --> 00:13:40.600
<i>What should I do...? If I won't be able
to see Lief and Barda again...</i>

00:13:43.320 --> 00:13:46.510
I really shouldn't have gotten so angry and shouted at him back there...

00:13:53.070 --> 00:13:55.540
Geez! Don't surprise me like that...!

00:13:55.540 --> 00:14:00.700
Now that I think of it, we fought against a giant snake in the City of the Rats, didn't we?

00:14:00.700 --> 00:14:02.140
That was a tough fight.

00:14:03.070 --> 00:14:08.280
I am the all-powerful Reeah, the
Shadow Lord's most trusted servant!

00:14:25.700 --> 00:14:27.630
This is unforgivable, you damn brat!

00:14:28.620 --> 00:14:30.750
Its head... has turned into three?!

00:14:34.060 --> 00:14:36.890
Prepare yourself, Lief of Del!

00:14:38.300 --> 00:14:39.140
Lief!!

00:14:53.770 --> 00:14:57.610
Jasmine also saved my life when
we fought against Reeah, didn't she...

00:14:58.840 --> 00:15:04.490
Perhaps I was influenced by Lief's recklessness, since I tried to defeat such giant monster with my small dagger...

00:15:05.540 --> 00:15:07.990
Or, Lief's bravery gave me courage.

00:15:08.600 --> 00:15:15.340
I can't imagine what would have happened to me if Barda and Jasmine weren't there when we were getting the lapis lazuli...

00:15:25.150 --> 00:15:25.900
Barda!

00:15:26.160 --> 00:15:28.500
<i>Hand over the belt...</i>

00:15:29.100 --> 00:15:32.200
<i>Offer the belt to The Hive now...!</i>

00:15:32.600 --> 00:15:33.610
<i>The belt...!</i>

00:15:33.610 --> 00:15:35.650
Stop it!!

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:38.110
Lief!!

00:15:44.560 --> 00:15:47.050
<i>After all, it was the two of them who saved me when I was lost in the sandstorm while seeing those illusions.</i>

00:15:47.050 --> 00:15:49.700
-Barda! Jasmine!!
<i>After all, it was the two of them who saved me when I was lost in the sandstorm while seeing those illusions.</i>

00:15:49.700 --> 00:15:50.040
-Barda! Jasmine!!

00:15:59.550 --> 00:16:04.220
Jasmine's wooden bird was also very useful when I took the lapis lazuli from the Tower of Death.

00:16:05.020 --> 00:16:05.930
This is it! The signal!

00:16:05.930 --> 00:16:06.600
-Right!
This is it! The signal!

00:16:08.400 --> 00:16:09.180
Barda!!

00:16:13.820 --> 00:16:14.400
It's here!

00:16:23.140 --> 00:16:26.450
There was also when we got the
emerald from Dread Mountain...

00:16:40.400 --> 00:16:41.060
Barda!

00:16:41.060 --> 00:16:42.760
Lief! Barda!!

00:16:42.860 --> 00:16:43.500
Watch out!

00:16:49.230 --> 00:16:50.520
Run, Lief!!

00:17:21.040 --> 00:17:23.570
The symbol of honour, the emerald...!

00:17:24.720 --> 00:17:28.210
Both Jasmine and Barda were
there to support me.

00:17:28.950 --> 00:17:29.790
Damn it...!

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:33.250
Lief... Jasmine... I hope you're both safe.

00:17:34.590 --> 00:17:38.610
Perhaps I could just shout loudly and grab the Carn Unit's attention...

00:17:39.240 --> 00:17:42.500
Then the two of them could use
that chance to get out of here.

00:17:43.800 --> 00:17:48.350
No, something like that wouldn't work; those two wouldn't abandon me to save themselves.

00:17:51.120 --> 00:17:54.400
I have to find those two again
somehow and resume our journey...

00:17:55.200 --> 00:17:57.900
and we won't stop until we have all seven gems!

00:18:11.790 --> 00:18:16.830
<i>My journey started on that day when the Belt of Deltora was passed on to Lief.</i>

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:21.700
<i>No, that's not right. It began when the Ak-Baba appeared in the sky that day.</i>

00:18:24.720 --> 00:18:25.600
Shit...!

00:18:32.830 --> 00:18:36.210
<i>From that day, when the Shadow Lord
took Del palace for himself,</i>

00:18:36.860 --> 00:18:43.600
and when King Endon and Queen Sharn escaped the palace with the help of Jarred the Blacksmith,

00:18:44.120 --> 00:18:46.200
my journey had begun.

00:18:48.330 --> 00:18:49.430
As well as that,

00:18:54.520 --> 00:18:55.760
Are you surprised?

00:18:58.630 --> 00:19:00.600
I hope you make it back safely.

00:19:03.340 --> 00:19:07.850
<i>My journey with Lief finally began, with Jasmine joining along the way.</i>

00:19:14.060 --> 00:19:18.150
And now, I just can't imagine continuing on this journey without Jasmine.

00:19:26.510 --> 00:19:28.730
Because right now, this is 'our' journey.

00:19:33.500 --> 00:19:35.800
I must find them before dawn!

00:19:39.160 --> 00:19:44.300
I have to find them, and thank them for
accompanying me on my journey up until now.

00:19:47.340 --> 00:19:51.400
And... I want to apologise for
shouting at him back then too...

00:19:55.540 --> 00:19:56.500
The fog is...?

00:19:59.420 --> 00:20:03.310
Somehow the fog doesn't
feel as hostile as before...

00:20:03.910 --> 00:20:06.100
What is this...? It feels almost warm...

00:20:06.670 --> 00:20:08.500
And it feels so kind and gentle...

00:20:13.390 --> 00:20:14.180
Jasmine!

00:20:14.400 --> 00:20:16.270
Geez, I was really worried, you know!

00:20:16.270 --> 00:20:17.500
Thank goodness...

00:20:17.900 --> 00:20:18.940
This fog...

00:20:18.940 --> 00:20:23.310
Could it be that this fog can actually connect with people's emotions and amplify them?

00:20:23.500 --> 00:20:29.100
That would explain why I felt so uneasy, and why you felt more irritated than usual.

00:20:29.530 --> 00:20:32.400
So, when we felt emotions of
kindness towards one another...

00:20:38.490 --> 00:20:40.590
Thank goodness; you're both safe!

00:20:40.740 --> 00:20:41.500
-Barda!
Barda!

00:20:41.500 --> 00:20:43.000
I was looking for you two!

00:20:43.080 --> 00:20:44.060
We were as well!

00:20:44.450 --> 00:20:47.000
Regardless, I'm glad that I could
meet with you guys again!

00:20:49.470 --> 00:20:51.920
Seems there's no time to
celebrate our reunion...

00:20:51.920 --> 00:20:52.840
I guess not.

00:21:02.300 --> 00:21:04.470
Shit. They're starting to congregate.

00:21:06.020 --> 00:21:06.930
This is bad!

00:21:07.090 --> 00:21:08.650
We'll be surrounded at this rate...!

00:21:08.910 --> 00:21:10.930
We need to distract them somehow...!

00:21:27.580 --> 00:21:29.590
The laughing owls are saving us...?

00:21:29.840 --> 00:21:31.520
This is our chance to run!

00:21:35.500 --> 00:21:36.510
Thank you!

00:21:49.170 --> 00:21:53.170
We should continue like this for a while to remain hidden from the Carn Unit.

00:21:54.090 --> 00:21:57.080
I suppose it's thanks to those owls
that we were able to get away.

00:21:57.080 --> 00:22:01.740
That's only because I treated its wound, you know, mister 'I hurt it because I was startled'.

00:22:03.220 --> 00:22:04.120
Alright, alright.

00:22:04.900 --> 00:22:05.690
Well, I mean...

00:22:05.690 --> 00:22:09.500
Although, that sharp tongue of
yours is very Jasmine-like.

00:22:10.190 --> 00:22:10.920
What?!

00:22:12.200 --> 00:22:13.600
Maybe I won't say it after all.

00:22:13.600 --> 00:22:14.900
What's that supposed to mean?!

00:22:15.820 --> 00:22:16.770
Nothing.

00:22:17.020 --> 00:22:18.590
Just spit it out already!

00:22:18.790 --> 00:22:20.290
There's no need to shout, is there?

00:22:20.290 --> 00:22:21.410
So what if I am?!

00:22:21.410 --> 00:22:26.310
Alright, cut it out. Let's all just keep moving; to the Maze of the Beast!

00:22:38.540 --> 00:22:47.800
How long has it truly been, I wonder?

00:22:47.800 --> 00:22:57.680
I've been watching the moon all this time, bathing in its light

00:22:57.680 --> 00:23:05.110
As we moved closer, a goddess passed over us

00:23:05.110 --> 00:23:14.780
And just like that, my little dream was carried away

00:23:15.620 --> 00:23:20.410
I saw you when I looked to the night sky

00:23:20.410 --> 00:23:20.460
Now that I think of it, your name was written there too
I saw you when I looked to the night sky

00:23:20.460 --> 00:23:25.040
Now that I think of it, your name was written there too

00:23:25.750 --> 00:23:29.340
Above me, a shooting star

00:23:29.340 --> 00:23:32.760
fades into the distance

00:23:33.890 --> 00:23:38.430
When the moonlight starts to wane

00:23:38.430 --> 00:23:43.100
I stand under the lazy morning's light

00:23:44.020 --> 00:23:47.400
And when that same moon rises

00:23:47.400 --> 00:23:56.240
I'll start moving all over again

